[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Finish setup
Name[ru]=Завершить настройку
Comment=Everything on this computer that only you can do, in one list, step by step
Comment[ru]=Всё, что на этом компьютере можно сделать только тебе, одним списком и по шагам
# Terminal=true: GNOME opens the terminal xdg-terminal-exec picks (see ~/.config/xdg-terminals.list). The shell, not the
# desktop file parser, expands $HOME (the parser expands neither `~` nor $HOME); --pause keeps the window open until
# Enter so the result can be read. The backslashes are two layers: Exec quoting (\" and \$ inside double quotes), each
# of them doubled again as a key-file string escape; tests/test_finish_setup_launcher.py pins the argv GLib makes of it.
Exec=sh -c "exec \\"\\$HOME/.local/bin/finish-setup\\" --pause"
Icon=system-software-install
Terminal=true
Categories=System;Settings;
Keywords=setup;finish;sign in;login;настройка;вход;
StartupNotify=true
